---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="About | Arasmas Labs">
  <main class="about-page">
    <section class="about-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT ARASMAS LABS</p>

      <h1>Independent Development, Research, and Experimentation.</h1>

      <p class="intro">
        Arasmas Labs is an independent laboratory built around the idea that
        useful systems emerge through experimentation, iteration, and
        deliberate refinement.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>What We Do</h2>

      <p>
        The lab develops technical projects, experimental systems, practical
        tools, and small-scale research efforts across software, hardware,
        artificial intelligence, fabrication, acoustics, and related fields. The lab functions as a pet project with this website being a main capture point for anything developed. 
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>How We Work</h2>

      <p>
        Projects are developed incrementally. Ideas are tested, documented,
        refined, and expanded only when the next stage is justified by what
        has already been learned.
      </p>

      <p>
        We take a project idea, expand upon the idea until it becomes a physically capable prototype idea. We then stress test the idea until we find faults with it.

      </p>

      <p>
        When an idea has been proven to be viable, we then move to a prototyping phase for actual development. After a successful prototype, we move to launch and production.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Current Projects</h2>

      <p>
        The current project portfolio centers on Project Theseus, Project
        Daedalus, and Project Hephaestus.
      </p>

      <p>
        Project Theseus is a software ecosystem built around the Nyx AI
        framework. Nyx is a modular, multi-agent AI system designed to support a wide range of 
        applications, from research and development to practical problem-solving.
      </p>

      <p>
        Project Daedalus is a collection of experimental prototypes, technical
        explorations, and research efforts. It serves as a proving ground and sandbox
        for new ideas, concepts, and technologies.
      </p>

      <p>
        Project Hephaestus is a practical fabrication and business initiative
        focused on the development of tools, systems, and products that can be
        used to support the Lab's ongoing work and to provide value to the broader community.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Version History</h2>

      <p>
        Major milestones and changes across Arasmas Labs are preserved in the
        project version history.
      </p>

      <a class="version-link" href="/about/version-history">
        View Version History
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-7) var(--page-padding);
  }

  .about-hero {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-7);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .about-section {
    max-width: 800px;
    padding: var(--space-5) 0;
    border-top: var(--border-width) solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .about-section h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .about-section p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .version-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .version-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>